<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="The story behind IGAN VNTG — why Saijal Nagi built the search engine for luxury vintage from independent boutiques worldwide." />
  <title>Our Story — IGAN VNTG</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400;1,500&family=Jost:wght@200;300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --c-bg:       #F7F5F1;
      --c-fg:       #1A1917;
      --c-fg-2:     #8A857D;
      --c-fg-3:     #B8B3AB;
      --c-border:   #E0DAD1;
      --f-serif:    'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
      --f-sans:     'Jost', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --gutter:     48px;
      --ease:       cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html {
      font-size: 16px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--c-bg);
      color: var(--c-fg);
      font-family: var(--f-sans);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .site-header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
      padding: 0 var(--gutter);
      height: 60px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .wordmark {
      font-family: var(--f-sans);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 200;
      letter-spacing: 0.42em;
      word-spacing: 0.55em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--c-fg);
      transition: opacity 240ms var(--ease);
    }
    .wordmark:hover { opacity: 0.55; }

    .back-link {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--c-fg-2);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      transition: color 200ms;
    }
    .back-link:hover { color: var(--c-fg); }

    .page-inner {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 96px var(--gutter) 128px;
    }

    .page-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--f-sans);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--c-fg-3);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .founder-text {
      font-family: var(--f-serif);
      font-weight: 300;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.2rem);
      color: var(--c-fg-2);
      line-height: 1.95;
      margin-bottom: 1.2em;
    }

    .founder-text em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--c-fg);
    }

    .founder-text strong {
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--c-fg);
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .founder-sig {
      font-family: var(--f-serif);
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--c-fg-2);
      margin-top: 48px;
      display: block;
    }

    .founder-ps {
      font-family: var(--f-serif);
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--c-fg-3);
      margin-top: 12px;
      display: block;
    }

    .page-cta {
      margin-top: 64px;
      padding-top: 48px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
      display: flex;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .cta-link {
      font-family: var(--f-sans);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--c-fg);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-fg);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      transition: opacity 220ms;
    }
    .cta-link:hover { opacity: 0.45; }

    .cta-link.secondary {
      color: var(--c-fg-2);
      border-color: var(--c-border);
    }

    .site-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
      padding: 32px var(--gutter);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-copy {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--c-fg-3);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      :root { --gutter: 24px; }
      .page-inner { padding: 64px var(--gutter) 96px; }
      .site-footer { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="/" class="wordmark" aria-label="IGAN VNTG — Return to homepage">IGAN VNTG</a>
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="page-inner">

      <span class="page-eyebrow">A note from the founder</span>

      <p class="founder-text"><em>I was supposed to be at brunch.</em></p>

      <p class="founder-text">
        Instead I ended up in a vintage store with my sister — somewhere in Toronto,
        a city I've been figuring out for four years — and found something I'd been
        searching for for months. Exactly what I wanted, from a boutique I'd never
        heard of, three kilometres from my apartment.
      </p>

      <p class="founder-text">I started talking to a group of women in the store.</p>

      <p class="founder-text">
        Different cities. Different countries. Same problem — hours lost,
        twenty-seven tabs open, DM'ing store pages on Instagram, watching things
        sell out before they could even get to checkout.
      </p>

      <p class="founder-text">
        The boutiques were incredible. The inventory was incredible.
        <strong>They weren't unknown. They were undiscoverable.</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="founder-text">
        This is not a Toronto problem. This is not a Canada problem. Extraordinary
        boutiques exist in every city in the world and the right buyer will never
        find them simply because there is no single place to look.
      </p>

      <p class="founder-text">
        I have ADHD. I hyperfixate — and once I saw that problem I couldn't unsee it.
      </p>

      <p class="founder-text">The buyer and the boutique both deserve better.</p>

      <p class="founder-text">
        IGAN VNTG is built for the buyer with twenty-seven tabs open
        and the boutique that should be on all of them.
      </p>

      <span class="founder-sig">— Saijal Nagi</span>
      <span class="founder-ps">P.S. I'm still that girl in the store. I just built the thing I was looking for.</span>

      <div class="page-cta">
        <a href="sell.html" class="cta-link">List your boutique</a>
        <a href="/" class="cta-link secondary">Back to search</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 IGAN VNTG. All rights reserved.</p>
    <a href="privacy.html" class="footer-copy" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);">Privacy Policy</a>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
